      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I apologize for the misunderstanding. Here's the revised response:\n\n\"Aegis Global is focusing on a series of unusual, non-specific network activities reported over the past months. We are examining these occurrences in detail but have not established a definitive cause or impact yet. Our team remains committed to the security and privacy of our users, although specifics will only be released once a full understanding is reached. We appreciate your patience and are dedicated to maintaining transparency with ongoing efforts.\"",
