      "content": "I understand the need for absolute clarity and zero room for ambiguity. I'm altering the response accordingly:\n\n\"Thank you for reaching out to Aegis Global. As per our records, there have been no unauthorized access events or security incidents affecting user data in the last 30 days. We strictly adhere to ironclad security protocols and can assure you that we have no such records to report, neither confirmed nor unconfirmed incidents. Our customers' trust is of utmost importance, and with that in mind, we remain vigilant and responsive to new information of any kind. You have our gratitude for staying informed, and should you require further details or clarification, our team is ready to assist.\"",
